<title>USA: Woburn, Mass won by Fleet Securities.</title>
<headline>Woburn, Mass won by Fleet Securities.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fleet Securities, Inc. said it won $7.045 million of Woburn, Mass., municipal purpose loan of 1997 bonds, with a true interest cost of 5.05 percent.</p>
</text>
